// off --color-text-primary onto --color-tutorial-card-text (this whole
// header/filter section uses that warm-ink token now), and opacity bumped
// 50% → 80% to match the design's "Dark / 80%" style on the selected
// chip's icon. A chip's icon only renders while that chip is selected (see
// LOOK_TYPES/LookSelectorChip, HomeScreen.tsx) — confirmed against a fresh
// get_design_context pull that Night/Glam genuinely have no icon in their
// unselected state.
